<title>USA: Chromaline forms European venture.</title>
<headline>Chromaline forms European venture.</headline>
<dateline>DULUTH, Minn. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chromaline Corp said Tuesday it had formed a European joint venture, Chromaline Europe SA, based in Saverne, France, to market Chromaline products.</p>
<p>&quot;This step will put the management of our European marketing and sales in the hands of experienced European business managers, many of whom are distributors of Chromaline products,&quot; Tom Erickson, president, said in a statement. &quot;We believe this structure for the joint venture will yield maximum penetration of the European market and enhance our profitability.&quot;</p>
<p>Chromaline makes and markets photochemical imaging systems for industrial markets.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
